/*
 * OpenTensor: Beyond First Light
 *
 * An AmigaOS 3.x demo for the Open stack:
 *   - Mesa / GLA / OpenGPU for 3D
 *   - OpenRTG / CyberGraphX for the display
 *   - ahi.device for generated 16-bit stereo sound
 *
 * The default is a private RTG screen, so GLA can use the screen-owned
 * OpenGPU presentation path. WINDOW deliberately selects the layered-window
 * compatibility path and is useful for measuring presentation changes.
 *
 * Copyright (c) 2026 Dalsin Limited.
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
 */
